---
description: BS/EN i18n — no hardcoded user-facing copy outside message files
globs: app/**/*.{ts,tsx}, components/**/*.{ts,tsx}, messages/**/*, i18n/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# i18n

- Locales: `bs` (default), `en`.
- Route under `[locale]`; do not hardcode locale-less user-facing strings in UI.
- Put copy in message catalogs; both BS and EN when adding UI text.
- Dates/times: respect clinic timezone (default `Europe/Sarajevo`).
- Phone inputs: default country `+387` unless clinic setting overrides.
